"The kwallet6 setting stays: Signal's database key now lives in the wallet, and switching back would lock you out."
msgstr ""
"De instelling kwallet6 blijft: de databasesleutel van Signal staat nu in de portefeuille, en terugschakelen zou je buitensluiten."

# needs review
